ocument/90/14821/dfas1n9dr6/"></a>Тугатилди 20____ й.______ __________________<a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasxut2ry/"></a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div align="right"><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table width="50%" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%"><tbody><tr><td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr424/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="424" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr424"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasy2k1n2/"></a>Ўзбекистон Республикаси бухгалтерия ҳисобининг миллий стандарти (19-сонли БҲМС) &#171;Инвентаризацияни ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш&#187;га</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr425/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="425" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr425"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaspto7pi/"></a>3-ИЛОВА</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr426/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="426" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr426"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasmx5fxl/"></a><strong>Инвентаризацияда аниқланган натижалар</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr427/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="427" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr427"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaszxuw5h/"></a><strong>ҚАЙДНОМАСИ</strong></p><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table width="100%" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3" style="width:18.3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anc