/14821/dfasgce1h4/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="5" style="width:156.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr556/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="556" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr556"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasgn8s5m/"></a><strong>ТИЛХАТ</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="5" style="width:156.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr557/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="557" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr557"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas8h3c9i/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="5" style="width:156.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr558/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="558" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr558"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasxxzwgr/"></a>Инвентаризацияни ўтказишни бошланишига асосий воситаларга тегишли бўлган барча чиқим ва кирим ҳужжатлари бухгалтерия хизматига топширилди ва менинг (бизнинг) жавобгарлигимга (жавобгарлигимизга) келиб тушган ҳамма асосий воситалар кирим қилинган, чиқиб кетганлари харажатга чиқим қилинган.</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="5" style="width:156.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr559/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="559" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr559"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas478i2u/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="5" style="width:156.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr560/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="560" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_