or="/document/90/14821/dfasolohy6/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="18" style="width:156.3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr771/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="771" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr771"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas311k78/"></a>Ушбу инвентаризация рўйхатида ____ дан ____гача рақамланган барча қимматликлар менинг (бизнинг) иштирокимда (иштирокимизда) комиссия томонидан ҳақиқатда текшириб чиқилди ва рўйхатга киритилди. Бу борада инвентаризация комиссиясига даъвоим (даъвоимиз) йўқ. Рўйхатда санаб ўтилган қимматликлар менинг (бизнинг) жавобгарлигимда (жавобгарлигимизда) сақланмоқда.</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="18" style="width:156.3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr772/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="772" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr772"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasvho31z/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td style="width:4.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr773/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="773" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr773"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfascw0nxr/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:15.1%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr774/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="774" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr774"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfast80rlr/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:1.3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr775/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="775" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr775"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasiufzyz/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:8.2%; wo