ияни ўтказишни бошланишига товар-моддий захираларга тегишли бўлган барча чиқим ва кирим ҳужжатлари бухгалтерия хизматига топширилди ва менинг (бизнинг) жавобгарлигимга (жавобгарлигимизга) келиб тушган ҳамма товар-моддий захиралар кирим қилинган, чиқиб кетганлари харажатга чиқим қилинган.</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="8" style="width:98.2%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1061/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1061" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1061"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasn4os2e/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="8" style="width:98.2%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1062/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1062" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1062"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaswm1qki/"></a>Моддий жавобгар шахс (шахслар):</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:15.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1063/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1063" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1063"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasl1gzgn/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:2.5%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1064/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1064" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1064"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaszz5kvw/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:5.6%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1065/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1065" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1065"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasp3kq1r/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:6%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1066/" data-role="phra