nchor="/document/90/14821/dfasigx41d/"></a><sup>(Ф.И.О.)</sup></p></td><td style="width:1.7%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1300/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1300" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1300"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasmoo2w4/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="8" style="width:156.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1301/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1301" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1301"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasewx03s/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="8" style="width:156.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1302/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1302" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1302"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfase0kqzi/"></a>Ушбу инвентаризация рўйхатида ____ дан ____гача рақамланган барча қимматликлар менинг (бизнинг) иштирокимда (иштирокимизда) комиссия томонидан натура кўринишида текширилди ва рўйхатга туширилди, шу муносабат билан инвентаризация комиссиясига даъвоим (даъвоимиз) йўқ. Рўйхатда санаб ўтилган қимматликлар менинг (бизнинг) жавобгарлигимда (жавобгарлигимизда) сақланмоқда.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="8" style="width:156.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1303/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1303" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1303"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaszpmvsh/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="8" style="width:156.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1304/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1304" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1304"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas8gzn4x/"></a>Моддий жавобгар шахс (шахслар):</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:23.9%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1305/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1305" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1305"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasortqzq/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:24.6%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1306/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1306" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1306"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasq596ck/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:3.1%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1307/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1307" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1307"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasn7g2is/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:13.1%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1308/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1308" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1308"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasbxin1k/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:3.1%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1309/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1309" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1309"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas4m882v/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:12.8%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1310/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1310" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1310"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfask3f1aw/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:16.4%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr1311/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1311" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1311"></a><a data-anchor="