ord-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4410/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4410" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4410"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasu6iyir/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:3.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4411/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4411" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4411"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasto4f8a/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:14.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4412/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4412" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4412"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas262hzw/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:3.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4413/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4413" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4413"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaslw5gvq/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:26.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4414/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4414" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4414"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasim3rnl/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:2.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4415/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4415" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4415"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas3a9ozp/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4416/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4416" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4416"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasxdo32o/"></a>Ушбу инвентаризация рўйхатида ____ дан ____гача рақамланган барча қимматликлар менинг (бизнинг) иштирокимда (иштирокимизда) комиссия томонидан натура кўринишида текширилди ва рўйхатга туширилди, шу муносабат билан инвентаризация комиссиясига даъвоим (даъвоимиз) йўқ. Рўйхатда санаб ўтилган қимматликлар менинг (бизнинг) жавобгарлигимда (жавобгарлигимизда) сақланмоқда.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4417/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4417" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4417"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfask5ntgv/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4418/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4418" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4418"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas1c2gps/"></a>Моддий жавобгар шахс (шахслар):</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4419/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4419" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4419"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasg6qooq/"></a>&#160;</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:64.4%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4420/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4420" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4420"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas0bqm7c/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:24.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4421/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4421"