-сонли БҲМС) &#171;Инвентаризацияни ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш&#187;га</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4980/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4980" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4980"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaslgxqdc/"></a>12-ИЛОВА</p><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4981/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4981" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4981"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas3h315l/"></a><strong>Нақд пул маблағларни инвентаризациядан ўтказишнинг _____ сон далолатномаси</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4982/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4982" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4982"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasne1ygu/"></a><strong>&#171;<strong>____</strong>&#187;<strong> ____________ 20__ йил</strong></strong></p><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" colspan="8" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4983/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4983" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4983"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasgnl1g3/"></a>СТИР</p></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="2" style="width:24.4%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr4984/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4984" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4984"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfashntcr7/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td colspan="6" rowspan="3" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/b