&#160;</td><td style="width:1.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5480/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5480" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5480"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasth33hf/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:14.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5481/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5481" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5481"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasgguv0k/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:1.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5482/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5482" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5482"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaslxkcy9/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:19.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5483/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5483" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5483"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasecgo6v/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5484/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5484" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5484"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasvk4gda/"></a>Ушбу инвентаризация рўйхатида ____ дан ____ гача рақамланган барча қимматли қоғозлар ва қатъий ҳисобот бланкалари менинг (бизнинг) иштирокимда (иштирокимизда) комиссия томонидан ҳақиқатда текшириб чиқилди ва рўйхатга киритилди. Бу борада инвентаризация комиссиясига даъвоим (даъвоимиз) йўқ. Рўйхатда санаб ўтилган қимматли қоғозлар ва қатъий ҳисобот бланкалари менинг (бизнинг) жавобгарлигимда (жавобгарлигимизда) сақланмоқда.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5485/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5485" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5485"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasf9rc0r/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5486/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5486" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5486"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasmhlfgg/"></a>Моддий жавобгар шахс (шахслар)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5487/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5487" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5487"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasadpnmk/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5488/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5488" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5488"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasremldm/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:9.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5489/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5489" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5489"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasannlgl/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:7.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5490/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5490" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5490"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasg0b81v/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:1.4%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5491/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-ph