ocument/90/14821/dfascr4mo5/"></a>&#160;</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5631/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5631" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5631"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasgz3i9i/"></a>Ўзбекистон Республикаси бухгалтерия ҳисобининг миллий стандарти (19-сонли БҲМС) &#171;Инвентаризацияни ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш&#187;га</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5632/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5632" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5632"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfascdazd2/"></a>14-ИЛОВА</p><p style="text-align:center"><a kazakh="yes" data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5633/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5633" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5633"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasplrd9d/"></a><strong>______ &#8212; сонли ХАРИДОРЛАР, МОЛ ЕТКАЗИБ БЕРУВЧИЛАР ВА БОШҚА ДЕБИТОРЛАР ВА КРЕДИТОРЛАР БИЛАН ҲИСОБ-КИТОБЛАРНИ ИНВЕНТАРИЗАЦИЯДАН ЎТКАЗИШ ДАЛОЛАТНОМАСИ</strong></p><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" colspan="7" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5634/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5634" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5634"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas7z7yq8/"></a>СТИР</p></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="2" style="width:33.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/bssPhr5635/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5635" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5635"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas1m8z2v/"></a>&#160;</