chor="/document/90/14821/dfaswox473/"></a>Қарзнинг бошланиш санаси</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width:26.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasrtg8nq/"></a>Қарз суммаси,</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas5dnmvm/"></a>сўм.</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width:50.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfashx2wz7/"></a>Қарзни ва даъво билдириш муддатини ўтказиб юборишда айбдор шахсни тасдиқловчи ҳужжат</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" style="width:13.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas7rgq97/"></a>дебиторлик</p></td><td class="bdAll" style="width:13.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas81wgvt/"></a>кредиторлик</p></td><td class="bdAll" style="width:16.4%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasx0ob96/"></a>номи</p></td><td class="bdAll" style="width:13.1%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasfhhbsg/"></a>сана</p></td><td class="bdAll" style="width:21.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasoehvqd/"></a>рақами</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:14.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasi2x4hc/"></a>1</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:26.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas7isakm/"></a>2</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:19.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasbyvi3n/"></a>3</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:18.1%; word-wrap:bre