ument/90/14821/dfas1hyyag/"></a>Бухгалтер</p></td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:44.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasoinrit/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:4.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasmo03gy/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:26.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasgrdwbp/"></a>&#160;</td><td style="width:4.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasmm1ygr/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" style="width:34.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfastuw70u/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 20%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasbvk141/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="width:44.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasiwvris/"></a><sup>(лавозими)</sup></p></td><td style="width:4.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaselepx3/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="width:26.8%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasbv32l9/"></a><sup>(имзо)</sup></p></td><td style="width:4.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas333631/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop" style="width:34.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaslcsnhy/"></a><sup>(Ф.И.О.)</sup></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasq8zp6n/"></a>Ўзбекистон Республикаси бухгалтерия ҳисобининг миллий стандарти (19-сонли БҲМС) &#171;Инвентаризацияни ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш&#187;га</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfass3vlvg/"></a>15-ИЛОВА</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasg3ews5/"></a><strong>_____-сонли Асосий воситаларнинг инвентаризация натижаларини солиштириш</strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasrcpgmv/"></a><strong>ҚАЙДНОМАСИ</strong></p><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdRight" colspan="8" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasswgqcu/"></a>СТИР -</p></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="2" style="width:31.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasww27sw/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas82akbw/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdTop bdRight" colspan="3" style="width:40.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas7w1gm2/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdAll" style="width:21.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaslgz43a/"></a>Кодлар</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="4" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasngyysb/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight" colspan="5" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasv3qptb/"></a>ИНВ-10-сон шакл БҲУТ бўйича -</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:21.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas5d3gwz/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td style="width: 3.66347%; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasgkfotr/"></a>Ташкилот</p></td><td class="bdBottom" colspan="3" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas3183tz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom" colspan="2" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas7esrhv/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight" colspan="3" style="width:40.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasiqi87n/"></a>Сана (йил, кун, ой) -</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:21.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas5ldz8b/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" colspan="3" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas4cgmsh/"></a>Ташкилотнинг таркибий бирлиги</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom" colspan="3" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasvcfu18/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdRight" colspan="3" style="width:40.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas5q8s37/"></a>КТУТ бўйича -</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:21.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasueqti0/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdTop" colspan="7" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasuqkde4/"></a>Инвентаризацияни ўтказиш учун асос: буйруқ, қарор, фармойиш</p></td><td class="bdRight" colspan="2" style="width:29.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfascxe7ai/"></a>ИФУТ бўйича -</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:21.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasexmn8o/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="6" style="overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasmfxfnk/"></a>(кераксизлари ўчирилади)</p></td><td class="bdRight" colspan="3" style="width:40.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaswmph9t/"></a>КТУТ бўйича -</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width:21.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas2nppza/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" st