ми)</sup></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasqminpx/"></a>____________________________________________________________________________да</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas3zagor/"></a><sup>(ташкилот, омбор, сақланадиган жой, цех, участка ва бошқаларнинг номи)</sup></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas3hqlqw/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasna10gl/"></a><strong>________-сонли Товар-моддий захираларни тўғри инвентаризациядан ўтказилганлигининг назорат текшируви далолатномаси</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas9lp63u/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasqpz2ef/"></a>Қуйидаги таркибдаги комиссия томонидан 20____й. &#171;_____&#187; _________ да товар-моддий захираларни инвентаризацияси ўтказилди:</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="width:98.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasan1pid/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr><td style="width:32.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasz2s2ml/"></a>Комиссия раиси:</p></td><td style="width:32.5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaswhx3iw/"></a>__________________</p></td><td style="width:33.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasolm7mu/"></a>___________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:32.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas