да қимматликларни инвентарлашни назорат текширувидан ўтказилганда тўлдирилади.</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaslqt622/"></a>Ўзбекистон Республикаси бухгалтерия ҳисобининг миллий стандарти (19-сонли БҲМС) &#171;Инвентаризацияни ташкил этиш ва ўтказиш&#187;га</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasger84d/"></a>18-ИЛОВА</p><div><div class="table-wide"><div><div><table style="table-layout: fixed; width: 100%" width="100%"><tbody><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3" style="width:3.5%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas2pi948/"></a>Т/р</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="3" style="width:14.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasmt0k35/"></a>Назорат текширувини ўтказган ходимнинг Ф.И.О. ва лавозими</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="3" style="width:18.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaszaby1g/"></a>Текширилаётган ташкилот, омбор, цехнинг номи</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="3" style="width:11.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaszncpfv/"></a>Моддий жавобгар шахснинг Ф.И.О.</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="3" style="width:14.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasby01xo/"></a>Назорат текширувини ўтказиш санаси</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width:18.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas6wgw7o/"></a>Инвентаризация қайдномасида кўрсатилган</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width:16.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfase5wgkm/"></a>Текширилган</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="4" style="width:29.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas37g0nx/"></a>Назорат текшируви натижалари</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="3" style="width:13.2%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas5k81km/"></a>Назорат текшируви натижалари бўйича маъмурият қарори</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="3" style="width:15%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasexgq6e/"></a>Назорат текширувини ўтказган шахснинг тилхати</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width:10%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas7z62zx/"></a>номлар сони</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width:8.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasaxs595/"></a>сумма</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width:8.6%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfas3b31i6/"></a>номлар сони</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" rowspan="2" style="width:8.3%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasilggpl/"></a>сумма</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width:14.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfasl2l3wo/"></a>камомад</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width:14.9%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfaswoxk5b/"></a>ортиқча</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:6.7%; word-wrap:break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/14821/dfast6xubg/"></a>сони</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width:8.3%; word